 "description": "Fiarly standard TRM, haven't seen a decent one posted in a while so i figured i'd post mine.",
 "strategy": "vs anything that sits at nonbattle grounds, ie senate or walkers start for luck v instead of the fish. Rest of the game is fairly strait forward, pull the docking bay, draw for twixes, use the 2 location and 1 3p0 pullers.  Battle with the epps and screaming guys.  Retrive with on draw thier fire, on the edge and flash.  Some match ups and card choices: Valorum + bacta tank for hit and runs vs senate, also ve senate epp luke + epp obi + gift of the mentor and some tracking can clear the senate.  VS walkers flash + sabotage + for luck + 3p0 will allow you to kill the cannon every turn till they grab sabotage.  VS anything in space load up home one with epp han + chewie, you'll get 2 destiny, 3 if lando there each is +2.  with a bunch of other guys on as forfit fodder you will slowly beat then off systems.",
